          "code": "RETURN_EXISTING_TACTICS",
          "id": "1765704397784",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765704397786_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a messageListWidget using the tactics data: {{$context.$nodes.GET_EXISTING_TACTICS.$output}} \n\ntitle: <tactic_name>\nsummary: <summary>\naction: \n\"ora.Invoke(\\\"{{$context.$nodes.REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA.$output.result.Action}}\\\", {\\\"TacticId\\\":\\\"<id from each row>\\\", \\\"ProgramId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$variables.programId}}\\\"})\"\n\n\n<tactic_name> - use the name from the tactics data.\n<summary> - Generate one line based on tactic objective and description\n\nRestrictions:\n\nDo not include badgeText, priority, timestamp\nSend empty widget rows if there are no tactics data present\n\nGenerate the title as: \n\nif there are no tactics data present, generate one line professional sentence to add tactics from the recommendations to make the program a great success.\nif there are tactics data present, do not generate title"
            },
            {
              "id": "1765704397784_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an assistant that outputs only the attributes related to oraInfoDisplay\nof messageListWidget. Do not include any additional text, explanations, or formatting.\nRespond with the exact data requested and nothing else."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
