              "id": "1765768691544_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "generate one high priority actionable insight with the following information:\n\n  title: \"Send all Tactics for Review\",\n  shortDescription: \"Send all Tactics for Review\",\n  actionText: \"Send all Tactics for Review\",\n  priority: \"low\",\n  followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(sendAllTacticsToReview, sendAllTacticsToReview({\\\"programId\\\": <programId>}))\"\n\n<programId> - {{$context.$variables.programId}}\n  \n\nOutput format: Return only the insight objects, nothing else."
            }
